         to .accessory at runtime when someone turns the Dock icon off. -->
    <key>LSUIElement</key>
    <false/>
    <key>NSHighResolutionCapable</key>
    <true/>
    <key>NSSupportsAutomaticTermination</key>
    <false/>
    <key>NSSupportsSuddenTermination</key>
    <false/>
    <!-- Sparkle. The canonical feed is served from amanu.me; the release binaries it
         points at live on GitHub. The public half of the EdDSA key pair is
         here so the app can refuse an update it cannot verify — the private
         half is not in this repository and never should be. -->
    <key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
    <array><dict><key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key><array><string>msauth.com.gravyraveydavey.jottie</string></array></dict></array>
    <key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Jottie records your microphone during meetings so you can transcribe them later. Transcription stays on this Mac unless you choose a cloud engine.</string>
    <key>NSAudioCaptureUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Jottie records system audio (the other side of your meetings) so you can transcribe them later. Transcription stays on this Mac unless you choose a cloud engine.</string>
    <key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Jottie reads your calendar to identify and name meetings and, if you enable it, start recording scheduled calls. Meeting titles and participants stay on this Mac unless you choose a cloud or CLI model for summaries or speaker names.</string>
</dict>
</plist>
